[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="MovementData" format=3 uid="uid://7vli7dipttql"]

; The reference's own copy of the movement numbers, frozen (TASK-9, criterion 16; F-044 §2): the
; numbers of data/movement_v0.tres on 2026-10-18, which the reference never reads. Tuning the game
; changes movement_v0.tres and leaves the reference alone; only a code change moves its path.
; Change a number here only together with the code that needs it, and record the trace again
; (bash tools/record_reference.sh), saying why in the commit message. The five numbers of the
; double jump and the stamina came on purpose with the code that reads them, on 2026-10-19
; (TASK-10.1, criterion 8), the five numbers of the dash on 2026-10-23 (TASK-10.4): the route
; never presses the dash, so its trace did not move; and the ten numbers of the wall run on the
; same day (TASK-10.5): the route touches no wall in the air, and its trace did not move either.
; The head ray and the lean on screen came on 2026-10-24 (TASK-10.10): the route still touches
; no wall in the air, and the lean is never in the state, so its trace did not move. The eight
; numbers of the grapple came on the same day (TASK-10.6): the route never presses the grapple,
; so its trace did not move.

